OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRemaining
OL,6,Fcloudy through the evening. Dry for
OL,7,Fmost although light, patchy rain
OL,8,Fpossible in the far south at times.
OL,9,FFeeling chilly, especially for
OL,10,Fsheltered rural areas.
OL,11,
OL,12,CFriday:FAnother cloudy day, with fewer
OL,13,Fbright breaks than on Thursday. Spots
OL,14,Fof patchy rain at times, though this
OL,15,Fwill mainly be focused around the
OL,16,Fsouth. Feeling cool.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
