OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FCool
OL,6,Fand cloudy conditions persisting
OL,7,Fthrough Saturday, with showers for
OL,8,Fsome. Fog and frost then pleasant
OL,9,Fautumnal sunny spells on Sunday.
OL,10,FRemaining dry but cloud thickening
OL,11,Fthrough Monday.
